                  ⇞           a page up
                  ⇟           a page down
                  ⎋ ⎋         stop the work of the thread
                  ⌃X R        resolve the thread
                  ⌃X D        revert the files that the last answer wrote
                  ⌃X Z        pause the thread, or resume it
